atlas provider

architecture provider-state
  canonical_name ProviderStateFold
  family provider
  domain Provider / Resource
  layer provider
  semantic_question What is a provider's current admissible state, folded from its event history?
  purpose Deterministic fold of provider events (including quota-reset timestamps in mixed formats) into current state.
  maturity implemented
  node_types Provider
  node_types ProviderEvent
  edge_types folds_into
  state_types available
  state_types throttled
  state_types exhausted
  forbidden_inference available -> authorized
  forbidden_inference cheapest -> valid
  source_path 10-Code/BonfyreControlPlane/provider_state.py
  source_path engine/core/src/control_provider.c
  witness 10-Code/BonfyreControlPlane/tests/test_provider_state.py
  source_lineage run6 control-plane retrospective

architecture resource-admission
  canonical_name ResourceAdmissionGraph
  family provider
  domain Provider / Resource
  layer provider
  semantic_question May this work be admitted, given resource and provider constraints right now?
  purpose The admission gate: resource and provider checks sit in the same position as the proof-frontier mutation gate.
  maturity implemented
  node_types AdmissionRequest
  node_types ResourceClass
  edge_types admits
  edge_types rejects
  forbidden_inference resource exists -> resource is reachable (activation is separate)
  source_path 10-Code/BonfyreControlPlane/resource_admission.py
  source_path engine/core/src/control_admission.c
  witness 10-Code/BonfyreControlPlane/tests/test_resource_admission.py
  source_lineage run6 control-plane retrospective
